{"id":"ac2effb31369eeeb","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-frobenius.md","title":"显式 Frobenius 比较箭头","display":"df-frobenius — 显式 Frobenius 比较箭头","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-frobenius","aliases":["16-df-frobenius","Frobenius reciprocity"],"display":"df-frobenius — 显式 Frobenius 比较箭头","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","[[16-df-general-quantifier]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"§1.9; Definition 3.4.1(ii) p. 191 (PDF 211); Definition 4.2.1","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-frobenius"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-frobenius</span><span>Frobenius reciprocity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-frobenius — 显式 Frobenius 比较箭头"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef7efb192e321ef0\" href=\"?note=ef7efb192e321ef0\" title=\"16-df-general-quantifier\">16-df-general-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§1.9; Definition 3.4.1(ii) p. 191 (PDF 211); Definition 4.2.1"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是带提升选择的纤维化，具有指定的纤维有限积及保积重索引，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 为基箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J\">\\(L:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J\\)</span> 是候选函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 是候选 Hom 映射族。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi)\\)</span> 及其余单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon^\\Phi\">\\(\\epsilon^\\Phi\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>；下面的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi)\">\\(\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi)\\)</span> 只在该伴随条件成立时使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*X\\times_IY\">\\(u^*X\\times_IY\\)</span> 的投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle-,-\\rangle_J\">\\(\\langle-,-\\rangle_J\\)</span> 为目标纤维的积配对。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)\\)</span> 检验指定伴随数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u)\">\\(\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u)\\)</span> 量化这些数据，不预设已选见证。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}\\)</span> 时，基底有指定有限积，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\">\\(\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\\)</span> 为其第一投影。</li>\n<li>仅在另行选定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_u,u^*,\\Phi^u)\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_u,u^*,\\Phi^u)\\)</span> 后使用无参数比较 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{u,X,Y}\">\\(\\varphi_{u,X,Y}\\)</span>；它按末式缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\epsilon^\\Phi_X\\circ L(\\pi_1),L(\\pi_2)\\rangle_J\n:L(u^*X\\times_IY)\\to X\\times_JLY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_J}(\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi))\n&amp;\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists L,\\Phi)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(\\pi_{I,J}),\\\\\n\\varphi_{u,X,Y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(\\Sigma_u,\\Phi^u).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\epsilon^\\Phi_X\\circ L(\\pi_1),L(\\pi_2)\\rangle_J\n:L(u^*X\\times_IY)\\to X\\times_JLY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_J}(\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi))\n&amp;\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists L,\\Phi)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(\\pi_{I,J}),\\\\\n\\varphi_{u,X,Y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(\\Sigma_u,\\Phi^u).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>比较箭头位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_J\">\\(\\mathcal E_J\\)</span>，要求的是由同一余单位和积投影构造的规范比较可逆。数据参数和存在谓词分别给出，因而不存在从伴随存在式中取出未绑定余单位的步骤。更换左伴随及其伴随数据时，规范伴随同构使两个比较方块交换，故存在性与任何已选见证的可逆性一致。</p>\n<p>预序情况下条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_u(u^*X\\wedge Y)\\simeq X\\wedge\\exists_uY\">\\(\\exists_u(u^*X\\wedge Y)\\simeq X\\wedge\\exists_uY\\)</span>。来源：Definition 3.4.1(ii), p. 191 (PDF 211)，以及 §1.9。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-general-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-general-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 是带提升选择的纤维化，具有指定的纤维有限积及保积重索引，见 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]。$u:I\\to J$ 为基箭头，$L:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J$ 是候选函子，$\\Phi$ 是候选 Hom 映射族。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi)$ 及其余单位 $\\epsilon^\\Phi$ 采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]；下面的 $\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi)$ 只在该伴随条件成立时使用。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J$、$Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I$，$\\pi_1,\\pi_2$ 为 $u^*X\\times_IY$ 的投影，$\\langle-,-\\rangle_J$ 为目标纤维的积配对。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)$ 检验指定伴随数据；$\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u)$ 量化这些数据，不预设已选见证。$\\mathrm{Iso}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。定义 $\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}$ 时，基底有指定有限积，$\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I$ 为其第一投影。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"L:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon^\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"u^*X\\times_IY","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle-,-\\rangle_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_u,u^*,\\Phi^u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{u,X,Y}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi)&\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\epsilon^\\Phi_X\\circ L(\\pi_1),L(\\pi_2)\\rangle_J\n:L(u^*X\\times_IY)\\to X\\times_JLY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_J}(\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(L,\\Phi))\n&\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\bot&\\neg\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,u^*,\\Phi),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists L,\\Phi)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Frob}_p(\\pi_{I,J}),\\\\\n\\varphi_{u,X,Y}&\\coloneqq\\varphi_{u,X,Y}(\\Sigma_u,\\Phi^u).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists_u(u^*X\\wedge Y)\\simeq X\\wedge\\exists_uY","display":false}],"bytes":2918,"backlinks":[{"id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}$ 是候选族，$\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}:\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\to\\mathcal E_{(I\\times J)\\times J}$ 为函子，$\\Phi_{I,J}$ 为候选自然 Hom 双射。$\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e)$、$\\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e)$ 在下文定义；$\\mathrm{AdjHom}$ 采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]，带数据参数的 $\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)$ 采用 [[16-df-frobenius]]。"},{"id":"5d4af07e194e762a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Frob}$ 采用 [[16-df-frobenius]]；$\\mathrm{Frob}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本页定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"45918fba7ae3214d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HasGenQuant}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$、$\\mathrm{Frob}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]；后两者的量化范围为所有基态射和所有存在的拉回方块。$\\mathrm{LogicFib}$ 是本页定义的组合性质。"},{"id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；等式、简单余积和 Frobenius 分别见 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["ee7c0663947fd7d2","ef7efb192e321ef0","a88937ea87ff8530","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}